1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,460
Most AI tutors stop at a chat box.

2
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:08,000
Canopy gives every learner a living model and an evidence trail.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,900
And one teacher that follows the reasoning.

4
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:13,600
Choose any of twenty languages.

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:18,700
Canopy translates every control, chart label, feedback message,

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:22,000
and source while preserving the learner's place.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,900
In physics, change launch speed, angle, gravity, or crosswind.

8
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:31,300
The browser-rendered three-dimensional trajectory, barrier clearance,

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:34,900
target landing, and teacher insight update together.

10
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,600
Switch subjects without losing context.

11
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:41,800
Here, the learner rotates a DNA helix, changes one base pair,

12
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,700
and compares the original strand with its variant.

13
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:47,400
Humanities use different evidence.

14
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:51,100
History filters a source constellation by perspective.

15
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:56,700
Civics traces repeated posts back to original and independent evidence

16
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:59,600
instead of pretending to be a truth machine.

17
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:03,700
The ethics landscape compares outcomes, rights, and uncertainty.

18
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,900
It leaves the verdict open.

19
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:11,100
Coach asks for your prediction and names the evidence it can defend.

20
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,800
Underneath, a course-specific reasoning graph updates mastery

21
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:17,000
and chooses the next useful move.

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,400
A provider-neutral adapter can add grounded live dialogue

23
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:24,500
without changing the inspectable curriculum.

24
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,600
Learn reveals the model.

25
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,800
Remix changes the context.

26
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:31,700
Apply tests transfer through roleplay.

27
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:35,800
Canopy is one AI tutor you can inspect.

28
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:40,700
It covers nine subjects and twenty languages in an ordinary browser.
